diff --git a/source/medicationdispense/medicationdispense-introduction.xml b/source/medicationdispense/medicationdispense-introduction.xml
index 0b95836fd5..34e8eb86f3 100644
--- a/source/medicationdispense/medicationdispense-introduction.xml
+++ b/source/medicationdispense/medicationdispense-introduction.xml
@@ -76,6 +76,7 @@ The code system used in medication dispense category is presented here but is ex
 <li><a href="https://jira.hl7.org/browse/FHIR-54372">FHIR-54372</a> - Lowered invariant mdd-1 (whenHandedOver cannot be before whenPrepared) from an error to a warning.</li>
 <li><a href="https://jira.hl7.org/browse/FHIR-49864">FHIR-49864</a> - Added an example with the authorizing MedicationRequest contained in the MedicationDispense, showing the number of authorized repeats: <a href="medicationdispense0337.html">medicationdispense0337</a>.</li>
 <li><a href="https://jira.hl7.org/browse/FHIR-59568">FHIR-59568</a> - Invariant mdd-1 now compares <code>whenHandedOver</code> and <code>whenPrepared</code> at their precision (<code>whenHandedOver.highBoundary() &gt;= whenPrepared.lowBoundary()</code>), so the warning is only raised when the handover is certainly before the preparation (for example, not when <code>whenHandedOver</code> has only a date).</li>
+<li><a href="https://jira.hl7.org/browse/FHIR-56428">FHIR-56428</a> - Renamed <code>notPerformedReason</code> to <code>statusReason</code>, as in the Event pattern: it gives the reason for the current status, for example why the dispense was not performed, put on hold, or resumed (this also covers <a href="https://jira.hl7.org/browse/FHIR-54366">FHIR-54366</a>: no restriction on which statuses can have a reason). Added the codes <code>on-hold</code>, <code>awaiting-authorization</code> and <code>issue-resolved</code> to the <a href="valueset-medicationdispense-status-reason.html">MedicationDispense Status Reason Codes</a> (example binding unchanged).</li>
 </ul>
 </blockquote>
 
